---
description: TypeScript, server components, and validation
alwaysApply: true
---

TypeScript strict. No `any`. Named exports except Next.js pages, layouts, and route handlers.

Server components by default. Add `use client` only for interaction.

Kebab-case file names. Use `cn` from `lib/cn.ts` for class names.

Validate every server input with Zod. Money is integer cents. Slugs stay stable and write a redirect when they change.

Keep components focused. Split a file that is doing two jobs.
